  <item>
    <title>08 什么？这年头还有人能扛得住猫猫狗狗的诱惑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ec14dc92cfee09e7b5264c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ec14dc92cfee09e7b5264c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Sep 2024 12:11:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>啊啊啊，好想救走车流里的小狗砸</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>可恶？流浪猫平均寿命只有2年！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你们会给路上撞到的猫猫狗狗收尸吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>那一夜，我被借宿的小狗偷心了&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一整个大无语😓，狂犬疫苗刚失效又被挠</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>超强台风也拦不住 我和流浪小猫的双向奔赴</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>什么！英俊小黑狗竟然被保安吃了！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>女同学说吃过猫猫</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>烫手山芋之《我的暴躁小猫》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>震惊！出租房上演人猫大战</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>绝育后性格大变</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>悼念...中途退出家庭的猫猫们</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>养猫生崽都是一场盲盒豪赌</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpdXLjoaa3H5vZErP2hc8ClDaRYr.m4a" length="45306322" type="audio/mp4"/>
