  <item>
    <title>07 相亲界的故事会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a25e5b33ddcbb53c15761f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a25e5b33ddcbb53c15761f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 14:16:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>冷门播客迎来了首任嘉宾：王哥！一个超级恋爱脑的已婚彩虹boy、左脚狂热忠粉（尤其爱听未剪辑版节目🤔）</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> 彩虹男孩试图相亲，首次出战就失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 醒醒吧！世界上就没有白马王子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> “他年纪这么大还没有结婚，肯定有问题”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 眼下乌青还来见面的加班牛马，我只能劝他保重身体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 何必呢？首次独自相亲，肉眼可见的手抖男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 一辈子总得相一次亲，我们新华图书城见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 开眼了！相亲相到同事，表面斯文私下居然是...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">38:09</a> 普信男：其实越漂亮的女生越好追…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a> 生气！还没结婚，发小妈妈就要求她去男生家过夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2595">43:15</a> 在妈妈心里，我只配这样的男生...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> 给妈妈的警钟：干涉我的选择，未来幸不幸福都会怪你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a> 原来在我的择偶要求里，说的都是最低标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3047">50:47</a> 震惊！随手捡了地上的垃圾也能成为结婚理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a> 当我设想老年后他还会这样照顾我，我就很想进入婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> 人生进度延期警告！大家开始交第二份考试时，我还在答第一场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3841">01:04:01</a> 分享局，一人一条情感建议</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ln4fTSdE1C6_CD2I-24YO5tCCIss.m4a" length="64070247" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqA09_W3Ma1SLzKMpIEI06mkGZpM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>06 你的童年我的童年好像不一样</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666c3b9db6a8412729ca160b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666c3b9db6a8412729ca160b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 12:46:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 六一节科普，想不到的心酸来由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 震惊！原来农村也会过六一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 请问：盛装参加儿童节还没得奖状会有多尴尬？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 漫山的茉莉花简直是童话里的样子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 干活也需要天赋？首次农活竟被扁担抡进田里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a> 在老爸的篓子里过河，大概是最美的童年记忆了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 地瓜的n种解锁方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 翻白眼游戏之【晴雨天】和【勾勾草】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 头顶棺材确实很难快乐荡秋千</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 记忆里最大暴雨！嘴皮被吹成波浪形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 长大后还你快乐吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 城市化下的农村再没了生命力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 如果没有长远计划，那咱就过好眼前的</span></p><span></span><p><span>为咱为数不多的听友们，献上经典老照片：</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧦袜子君和她的小河</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiBeO3mDrtDLofw4b0uQPp_wQ7B3.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqQuGAtCmVY1BlMDwDUJDDJwRuL2.m4a" length="50076923" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqA09_W3Ma1SLzKMpIEI06mkGZpM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>05 让我好好来夸夸你吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664ed9e0c59d1e57571f15f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664ed9e0c59d1e57571f15f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2024 05:53:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本台首次水性干货来啦！马屁精袜子君传授独家心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 反面案例不要学！领导指责式夸夸，阿修罗白眼压不住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 袜子君分享独家3大夸夸技巧，尤其是后面两条一定要听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a> 看到他既享受又嫌弃的表情，我就觉得得逞了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> emmm...其实面对被夸，我也不知所措</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 参考性不高的反夸技巧，易翻车谨慎抄作业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a> “你可以的”好比衙门的“明镜高悬”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 赞美有魔力，快去好好夸夸身边人吧～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrQ6jxDUbELtpsqb_-oR-0j_d4Yj.m4a" length="30526966" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:27</itunes:duration>
