  <item>
    <title>04 三分天注定 七分靠算命</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6645a011251bd96e6cb54451</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6645a011251bd96e6cb54451</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 05:56:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这 是一档关于「自我探索」和「一些有的没的」的闲聊播客。这是我们的第4期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期里，我们讨论了：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> “我爷爷可是远近闻名的算命先生”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> 怪不得！原来是记混了命数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 重金求子，妈妈帮我疯狂拜拜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 往北边找，你就会找到丢的羊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 亲历灵魂出窍的空气静止感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 菩萨说：天资如此不强求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 当月做梦，次月怀孕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a> 你今年运气很好，考不上就别复读了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> 洋教初体验，拉满的仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> 超感人！陌生人竟帮我祈祷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> 塔罗测姻缘：未来半年我可以脱单吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 算命先生是最高性价比的心理咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 当代科学迷信：咱只信好的就对了！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt9zmqgepavKGJCW7QBmOzdN9nFd.m4a" length="43128746" type="audio/mp4"/>
