    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqA09_W3Ma1SLzKMpIEI06mkGZpM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03 大多时候 治愈都是自我功课</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6628f9e4200abebe6e0536a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6628f9e4200abebe6e0536a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 12:24:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一档关于「自我探索」和「一些有的没的」的闲聊播客。这是我们的第3期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期里，我们讨论了：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 办公室里「老年痴呆症」初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 坐在面前的人，仿佛被切了对角线，一半都是黑的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 34岁的我，确诊了脑梗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> 生理疾病后，心态跌落到湖底...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 克制是成年人的关心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 觉醒后：tmd他骂我！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> 33岁的我，确诊了「回避型人格」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a> 智性恋姐姐说：谈恋爱可以帮你认识世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 人生就像百事可乐的〰️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 自我疗愈才是大多数人的常态</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果在收听节目的你，有得到🤏🏻小能量，或有相似的感受，或有想对我们说的话，请向我们发射的小小的信号吧~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnsKUN5UCoJdZZEa1iRfIHhkGZ3L.m4a" length="40783221" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqA09_W3Ma1SLzKMpIEI06mkGZpM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02 我们可以错 但一定要试</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6617277b5dae7932c6b5b3f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6617277b5dae7932c6b5b3f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Apr 2024 23:57:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一档关于「自我探索」和「一些有的没的」的闲聊播客。这是我们的第2期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期里，我们讨论了：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> 叛逆染头，婶子们秒变y2k姐妹花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 自己觉得糟糕透了，但原来大家觉得还不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> 「不拒绝」对回避人格来说，已经是释放超强信号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a> 对人生伴侣的期待就像「魂斗罗」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 我在阿里环线，差点以为我的人生已经下不去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> “遇到贵人的几率很小，加上老板的微信是你的荣幸”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 做减法，有限的精力去做重要的事</span></p>]]></description>
