    <title>01 十全八美就出发！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660cc6a54f66d1c1dac11660</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660cc6a54f66d1c1dac11660</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 03:01:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我们的第1期，也许它不是十全十美，但我们已经迈开腿子出发啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一集里，我们讨论了：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 参加人大代表大会做记录员，我睡着了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 迎新晚会后，都喊我「狮子座学姐」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 我很i，但是我大学跳街舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 一回头，你被夹在了你同桌的腋下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 阿修罗是个很迷信的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">24:03</a> 34岁的我突然看懂了《楚门的世界》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 我觉得我没有爸爸说的那么好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> 未舒展的小叶芽，“啵啾”一下就撑开了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 「十全八美」专治完美病，至少腿子迈开了！</span></p>]]></description>
